{"id":"n24848-1-7","stage":4,"title":"잠자리 · 床铺","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24848-1-7-1","ko":"너는 아침에 일어나서 잠자리도 정리 안 했더구나.","zh":"你早上起床后连床铺都没整理呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어나서","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠자리도","meaning":"床铺，睡铺","explanation":"잠자리：床铺，睡铺；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"잠자리","audio":"/audio/553c2296552e652c652b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24848","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정리","meaning":"整理，收拾，清理","explanation":"정리：整理，收拾，清理","readings":[{"term":"정리","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75781","senseId":"1","lemma":"정리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했더구나.","meaning":"做（정리를 하다：整理）","explanation":"하다：做（정리를 하다：整理）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더구나：回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"553c2296552e652c","term":"잠자리","zh":"床铺，睡铺","audio":"/audio/553c2296552e652c652b.mp3","entryId":"24848","definition":"为睡觉而准备的被褥。","pronunciation":["잠짜리"]},{"id":"829a277fc72022a6","term":"정리","zh":"整理，收拾，清理","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3","entryId":"75781","definition":"将处于散乱状态的东西归整到一起或扔掉。","pronunciation":["정ː니"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（정리를 하다：整理）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（정리를 하다：整理）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/493cd7b3be9ea2e52447.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24848-1-7-2","ko":"죄송해요, 늦잠을 자서 그랬어요.","zh":"对不起，是因为我睡过头了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦잠을","meaning":"懒觉","explanation":"늦잠：懒觉；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"늦잠","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41393","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자서","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그랬어요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"4dc69297f0f60b6c","term":"늦잠","zh":"懒觉","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3","entryId":"41393","definition":"早上睡到很晚的觉。","pronunciation":["늗짬"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c6eb1450fb31d3627cba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24848","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，是因为我睡过头了。","你早上起床后连床铺都没整理呢。","那家里怎么有那么多人进进出出的啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你早上起床后连床铺都没整理呢。","那家里怎么有那么多人进进出出的啊？","对不起，是因为我睡过头了。"],"answer":2}]}
